      "zh": {
        "title": "民航局協調選舉疏運增班 部分離島航班訂位近滿",
        "summary": "民航局協調選舉疏運增班；國內航線提供1,010架次；部分離島航班訂位近滿",
        "body": [
          "民航局表示，為因應地方公職人員選舉期間離島民眾返鄉投票需求，已協調航空公司規劃航班及加開班機，增加離島航線運能。選舉疏運期間（11月27日至30日）國內航線共提供1,010架次、73,864個座位，其中澎湖、金門及馬祖航線合計提供68,590個座位。",
          "民航局表示，目前離島航線訂位需求踴躍，部分日期及時段航班已近滿訂，並提醒有返鄉需求的民眾也可利用海運船班，彈性安排往返行程。11月27日基隆往馬祖、高雄往澎湖等海運船班尚有艙位可供訂位。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "CAA Taiwan coordinates extra flights for election travel; some island flights are nearly full",
        "summary": "CAA Taiwan coordinates election-period extra flights; some island flights are nearly full.",
        "body": [
          "CAA Taiwan said it had coordinated with airlines to schedule flights and add services in response to demand from outlying-island residents returning to vote in the local elections. Domestic routes are scheduled to offer 1,010 flights and 73,864 seats during the election travel period, Nov. 27-30. Routes serving Penghu, Kinmen and Matsu will provide a combined 68,590 seats.",
          "Bookings on outlying-island routes were strong, and flights on some dates and at some times were nearly full, CAA Taiwan said. The authority advised people traveling home to also consider sea services and make flexible travel arrangements. Sailings on Nov. 27 from Keelung to Matsu and from Kaohsiung to Penghu still had space available for booking."
        ]
      },
